{
 "id": 2369885,
 "name": "Export main recipe",
 "description": "The export recipe is the main recipe that export entities into a json file and stores it in your Reltio tenant's S3 bucket. This recipe calls another a callable recipe named 'Export Callable Recipe', so you will need to look for that as well on the community and clone into your RIH instance along with this recipe. \n\nThe export main recipe is used to pass the filter criteria to the callable recipe and based on the filter criteria the records are exported in to a file.\n\nHow to run the recipes: Use the start recipe button in both the recipes:\n1. Export Main Recipe\n2. Export Callable Recipe\n\nYou can enhance this recipe once you have cloned into your Reltio Integration Hub instance according to you needs.\n\n",
